---
import BaseLayout from "../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import site from "../../../../config/site.json";
---

<BaseLayout title="Panduan Kontributor" description={`Cara berkontribusi pada proyek ${site.name}.`} lang="id">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-ink mb-6">Panduan Kontributor</h1>
    <p class="text-stone text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
      [PLACEHOLDER: Cara berkontribusi kode, menulis dokumentasi, dan melaporkan kendala pada proyek {site.name}.]
    </p>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="p-6 bg-card border border-line rounded-lg">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Kode etik</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone leading-relaxed">
          [PLACEHOLDER: Kami berkomitmen menyediakan lingkungan kolaborasi yang ramah, aman, dan inklusif bagi seluruh kontributor.]
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 bg-card border border-line rounded-lg">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-2">Mencari issue pertama</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone leading-relaxed">
          [PLACEHOLDER: Lihat daftar issue bertanda good first issue di repositori kami untuk memulai kontribusi pertama Anda.]
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

